    "text": "By Kirsten Wisniewski ,\n5 hours ago Andrew Beavers is the Vacation Rental Administrator and Compliance Officer for Cook County Land Services. Beavers took on the role in 2024, and has been tracking and compiling data over the past two years. He presented the information he has compiled to the Board of Commissioners at their November Committee of the Whole meeting. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
